==Major events==
{{spoilers}}
*The 10th [[Pokémon League]] tournament starts with an {{wp|exhibition game|exhibition match}} between the [[Gym Leader]]s of [[Kanto]] and [[Johto]].
* {{adv|Silver}} returns Tyranitar to [[Lance]].
* [[Masked Man]]'s objective is uncovered by Lance.
* Silver and {{adv|Blue}} encounter Entei at [[Indigo Plateau]].
* {{adv|Blaine}} befriends {{p|Entei}} and has his wounds healed.
* The Masked Man attacks the Pokémon League and kidnaps the Gym Leaders and [[Kurt]].
* It is revealed that [[Chuck]] trained {{adv|Blue}} when he was younger.

